# ApexPost tracking API (Week 4, Parts B and C): one success and at least one failure request per endpoint, for both
# API versions. Open in Visual Studio or VS Code (REST Client) and send the requests top to bottom; later requests use
# the shipments the earlier ones create. Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/ApexPost.Api --launch-profile http
# The tracking numbers below must not exist yet. On a database that already has them, change the four variables.
# All data is fictional.
#
# v2 is the current version. v1 is deprecated: each successful v1 response carries Deprecation, Sunset and Link
# headers (see VERSIONING.md). Every response reports api-supported-versions: 2.0 and api-deprecated-versions: 1.0.
#
# Every API request needs a bearer token. The first request gets a one-hour Courier and Admin token from the
# Development-only POST /dev/token; the requests after it send it as {{token}}. With dotnet user-jwts instead, replace
# {{token}}'s definition with the token it prints (SECURITY.md).

@host = http://localhost:5245
@v2Number = APX-24200001
@v2Deletable = APX-24200002
@v1Number = APX-24100001
@v1Deletable = APX-24100002
# The token from the login request below (# @name login).
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Health check, no token needed -> 200
GET {{host}}/health

### Get a development token (Development only): roles Courier and Admin, courier CR-001 -> 200
# @name login
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kofi Boateng", "roles": ["Courier", "Admin"], "courierId": "CR-001" }

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Authentication
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### No token -> 401 ProblemDetails, WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments

### An invalid token -> 401, WWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token"
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer not-a-valid-token

### A valid token -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documents and versions
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### The v2 OpenAPI document (Development only) -> 200
GET {{host}}/openapi/v2.json

### The v1 OpenAPI document, marked deprecated -> 200
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### A version that does not exist -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/v3/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Version 2 (current): nested recipient, latestScan, enums by name
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### v2 1. POST /api/v2/shipments: create -> 201 Created, Location: /api/v2/shipments/APX-24200001, latestScan null
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "{{v2Number}}",
  "recipientName": "Ama Mensah",
  "recipientPhone": "+44 20 7946 0000",
  "recipientAddress": "12 Harbour Road",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 4.25
}

### v2 1. POST /api/v2/shipments: the same tracking number again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "{{v2Number}}",
  "recipientName": "Ama Mensah",
  "recipientPhone": "+44 20 7946 0000",
  "recipientAddress": "12 Harbour Road",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 4.25
}

### v2 1. POST /api/v2/shipments: invalid values -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails (tracking number, phone, weight, missing city)
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "APX-123",
  "recipientName": "Ama Mensah",
  "recipientPhone": "020 7946 0000 ext 5",
  "recipientAddress": "12 Harbour Road",
  "weightKg": 70.5
}

### v2 1. POST /api/v2/shipments: not JSON -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: text/plain

trackingNumber=APX-24200009

### v2 2. GET /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber} -> 200 OK, "status": "Created", "recipient": { ... }
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 2. GET /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: unknown -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 3. GET /api/v2/shipments: page 1, 20 per page, filtered by status and city -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Created&city=Portside
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 3. GET /api/v2/shipments: pageSize above 50 -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments?pageSize=51
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 4. PUT /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: replace the editable details -> 200 OK
PUT {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Kofi Mensah",
  "recipientPhone": "(020) 7946-0001",
  "recipientAddress": "3 Quay Street",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 4.5
}

### v2 4. PUT /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: invalid phone and weight -> 400
PUT {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Kofi Mensah",
  "recipientPhone": "12",
  "recipientAddress": "3 Quay Street",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 0
}

### v2 4. PUT /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: unknown -> 404
PUT {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Kofi Mensah",
  "recipientPhone": "(020) 7946-0001",
  "recipientAddress": "3 Quay Street",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 4.5
}

### v2 5. PATCH /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/status: Created -> PickedUp -> 200 OK
PATCH {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PickedUp" }

### v2 5. PATCH /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/status: skipping to Delivered -> 409 Conflict (names the allowed next status)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Delivered" }

### v2 5. PATCH /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/status: unknown status -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Lost" }

### v2 6. POST /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: offline scans -> 200 OK, accepted 2, rejected 1, "shipmentStatus": "InTransit"
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "scanType": "Pickup", "location": "Riverside Depot", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T08:00:00Z", "notes": "Collected from front desk" },
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000002", "scanType": "InTransit", "location": "Central Sorting, Belt 4", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T11:30:00Z" },
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000003", "scanType": "Delivered", "location": "12 Harbour Road", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T15:00:00Z" }
  ]
}

### v2 6. POST /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: the same upload again -> 200 OK, accepted 0, duplicatesSkipped 2 (idempotent)
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "scanType": "Pickup", "location": "Riverside Depot", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T08:00:00Z", "notes": "Collected from front desk" },
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000002", "scanType": "InTransit", "location": "Central Sorting, Belt 4", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T11:30:00Z" },
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000003", "scanType": "Delivered", "location": "12 Harbour Road", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T15:00:00Z" }
  ]
}

### v2 6. POST /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: a scan time in the future -> 400 (custom rule, key scans[0].scannedAtUtc)
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000004", "scanType": "Delivered", "location": "12 Harbour Road", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2099-01-01T08:00:00Z" }
  ]
}

### v2 6. POST /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: unknown shipment -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-99999999/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a002-0000-7000-8000-000000000005", "scanType": "Pickup", "location": "Riverside Depot", "courierId": "CR-001", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-01T08:00:00Z" }
  ]
}

### v2 2. GET /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: after the scans -> 200 OK, "latestScan": { "scanType": "InTransit", ... }
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 7. GET /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: history, oldest first, scan types by name -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 7. GET /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: unknown shipment -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-99999999/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 8. DELETE /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: already InTransit -> 409 Conflict
DELETE {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 8. DELETE: create a second shipment to delete -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "{{v2Deletable}}",
  "recipientName": "Esi Owusu",
  "recipientPhone": "0207946002",
  "recipientAddress": "7 Mill Lane",
  "city": "Rivermouth",
  "weightKg": 0.8
}

### v2 8. DELETE /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: still Created -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Deletable}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v2 8. DELETE /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: already deleted -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2Deletable}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Version 1 (deprecated): the Part B contract. Flat recipient fields, enums as numbers.
# Successful responses carry Deprecation: @1794182400, Sunset: Mon, 31 May 2027 00:00:00 GMT and Link headers.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### v1 1. POST /api/v1/shipments: create -> 201 Created, Location: /api/v1/shipments/APX-24100001, "status": 0
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "{{v1Number}}",
  "recipientName": "Yaw Asante",
  "recipientPhone": "+44 20 7946 0100",
  "recipientAddress": "21 Dock Road",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 2.5
}

### v1 1. POST /api/v1/shipments: the same tracking number again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "{{v1Number}}",
  "recipientName": "Yaw Asante",
  "recipientPhone": "+44 20 7946 0100",
  "recipientAddress": "21 Dock Road",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 2.5
}

### v1 1. POST /api/v1/shipments: missing fields -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "trackingNumber": "{{v1Number}}" }

### v1 1. POST /api/v1/shipments: not JSON -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: text/plain

trackingNumber=APX-24100009

### v1 2. GET /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber} -> 200 OK, flat recipient fields, "status": 0
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 2. GET /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}: not a tracking number -> 404 (the route constraint never matches)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/12345
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 3. GET /api/v1/shipments: filtered by status number and city -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments?status=0&city=Portside
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 3. GET /api/v1/shipments: page 0 -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 4. PUT /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}: replace the editable details -> 200 OK
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Yaw Asante",
  "recipientPhone": "+44 20 7946 0101",
  "recipientAddress": "23 Dock Road",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 2.75
}

### v1 4. PUT /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}: unknown -> 404
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-99999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Yaw Asante",
  "recipientPhone": "+44 20 7946 0101",
  "recipientAddress": "23 Dock Road",
  "city": "Portside",
  "weightKg": 2.75
}

### v1 5. PATCH /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/status: by number, 1 = PickedUp -> 200 OK
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": 1 }

### v1 5. PATCH /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/status: back to Created -> 409 Conflict
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Created" }

### v1 6. POST /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: offline scans -> 200 OK, accepted 1, "shipmentStatus": 2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a001-0000-7000-8000-000000000011", "scanType": "InTransit", "location": "Central Sorting, Belt 2", "courierId": "CR-002", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-02T09:15:00Z" }
  ]
}

### v1 6. POST /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: the same scan ID twice in one upload -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scans": [
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a001-0000-7000-8000-000000000012", "scanType": "InTransit", "location": "Central Sorting, Belt 2", "courierId": "CR-002", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-02T09:15:00Z" },
    { "scanId": "scan::0199a001-0000-7000-8000-000000000012", "scanType": "InTransit", "location": "Central Sorting, Belt 2", "courierId": "CR-002", "scannedAtUtc": "2026-11-02T09:15:00Z" }
  ]
}

### v1 7. GET /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: history, scan types as numbers -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 7. GET /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: unknown shipment -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/APX-99999999/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 8. DELETE: create a second shipment to delete -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "{{v1Deletable}}",
  "recipientName": "Abena Darko",
  "recipientPhone": "0207946003",
  "recipientAddress": "4 Ferry Lane",
  "city": "Rivermouth",
  "weightKg": 1.2
}

### v1 8. DELETE /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}: still Created -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Deletable}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### v1 8. DELETE /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}: already InTransit -> 409 Conflict
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/shipments/{{v1Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Part B URLs without a version: an alias of v1 until v1's sunset (VERSIONING.md)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### GET /api/shipments/{trackingNumber}: answers as v1, with v1's deprecation headers -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/shipments/{{v1Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Both versions read the same shipment: the v1 one in v2's shape -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v1Number}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
